WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:07.273
AUDIENCE: (CHEERING)
Rel! Rel! Rel! Rel! Rel!

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.542
LIL REL HOWERY:<i> I'm from
 the West Side of Chicago.</i>

00:00:10.242 --> 00:00:12.078
<i> I used to walk up and down
 this street.</i>

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:15.582
Seeing my name on this building
is insane.

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:17.417
This is why I knew I was back
in Chicago, right?

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.253
I was looking at my name
on the marquee.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:23.689
I'm standing there
having a moment to myself,
like, "Damn! This shit crazy."

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:25.725
And then a nigga
came outta nowhere,
like, "Hell yeah, it is."

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:27.027
I'm like,
"Who the fuck is you, nigga?"

00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:28.628
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:31.131
AUDIENCE: (CHEERING)
Rel! Rel! Rel! Rel! Rel!

